   So "cab" requires 2 swaps. NO.
6. "cba": $s[0]=c$ (wrong), $s[1]=b$ (ok), $s[2]=a$ (wrong). Swapping $s[0]$ and $s[2]$ gives "abc". YES.

So the condition is:
- If string is "abc", YES.
